# PupArt Portraits - Environment Variables Example
# Copy this file to create your own local configuration

# =============================================================================
# STRIPE CONFIGURATION
# =============================================================================
# Get your Stripe API keys from: https://dashboard.stripe.com/apikeys
# Use test keys (pk_test_/sk_test_) for development
# Use live keys (pk_live_/sk_live_) for production

STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_live_YOUR_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY_HERE
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_YOUR_STRIPE_SECRET_KEY_HERE

# =============================================================================
# FTP DEPLOYMENT CONFIGURATION (for deploy.sh)
# =============================================================================
FTP_HOST=your_ftp_host
FTP_USER=your_ftp_username
FTP_PASS=your_ftp_password
REMOTE_DIR=.

# =============================================================================
# ADMIN CONFIGURATION
# =============================================================================
ADMIN_PASSWORD=your_secure_password_here

# =============================================================================
# SETUP INSTRUCTIONS
# =============================================================================
# 1. Copy this file and rename it to just ".env" (remove .example)
# 2. Replace all placeholder values with your actual credentials
# 3. Never commit the .env file to Git (it's already in .gitignore)
# 4. For deployment, manually update credentials in:
#    - scripts/stripe-config.js (STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY)
#    - api/create-checkout-session.php (stripe_secret_key)
#    - api/process-payment.php (stripe_secret_key)
#    - deploy.sh (FTP credentials)
